## 2. Infrastructure & Third-Party Service Cost Estimation (OpEx)

This table outlines the hosting, database, notification channel gateways, and API subscription costs over a **12-month duration**.

| # | Server / Service | Specification | Cost/Month (₹) | Duration (Months) | Total Cost (₹) |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| 1 | Application Server (API) | 4 vCPU, 8 GB RAM, 50 GB SSD – Azure/AWS | ₹4,500 | 12 | ₹54,000 |
| 2 | Database Server (PostgreSQL) | 4 vCPU, 16 GB RAM, 100 GB SSD – Managed DB | ₹6,000 | 12 | ₹72,000 |
| 3 | SMS & WhatsApp Gateway | Twilio/MSG91 (25k OTP and notification messages/month) | ₹4,000 | 12 | ₹48,000 |
